sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant LJ as LocalJudge(前端)
    participant API as FastAPI judge 路由
    participant DB as SQLAlchemy(SQLite)
    participant RUN as judge.run_case(父进程)
    participant H as judge_harness(子进程)

    U->>LJ: 点击「运行样例」
    LJ->>API: onSave() 保存当前草稿
    LJ->>API: POST /api/sessions/{id}/judge<br/>{language, expected_code}
    API->>DB: get_session(id) 校验存在与 origin
    API->>API: 校验 language / expected_code 与服务器草稿一致
    API->>API: 取 EXAMPLES[example_id].method 与 cases
    loop 每个用例 case
        API->>RUN: run_case(code, method, case, timeout=4s)
        RUN->>H: subprocess.run([python, -I, judge_harness.py])<br/>stdin=JSON{code, method, case}, cwd=临时目录
        H->>H: 导入白名单 + 替换危险内建 + exec 用户代码
        H->>H: getattr(Solution(), method)(**case.input)
        H->>RUN: stdout 返回 JSON{passed, actual, stdout, error}
        RUN-->>API: 单用例结果（含 timeout/超限标记）
    end
    API->>API: 聚合 verdict / passed / total + verification 文案
    API-->>LJ: 200 JudgeResult
    LJ-->>U: 渲染每个用例通过/失败、输入/期望/实际、stdout、错误
